{"__q": {"t": "Косвенная речь — Сборник 2", "q": [{"s": "Report: «I can swim,» she said.", "o": ["She said she can swim.", "She said she swims.", "She said she could swim.", "She said she could to swim."], "e": "can → could."}, {"s": "Report: «I must go,» he said.", "o": ["He said he must to go.", "He said he musted go.", "He said he had to go.", "He said he must go."], "e": "must → had to."}, {"s": "In reported speech «tomorrow» becomes:", "o": ["yesterday", "the next day", "tomorrow", "that day"], "e": "Выражение будущего времени меняется."}, {"s": "Report: «Let's go,» he said.", "o": ["He said let's go.", "He told to go.", "He suggested going.", "He asked going."], "e": "Предложение → suggest + герундий."}, {"s": "Which verb is used for reporting advice?", "o": ["refuse", "order", "deny", "advise"], "e": "«Advise somebody to do» — конструкция."}, {"s": "Report: «I didn't do it,» he said.", "o": ["He offered doing it.", "He denied doing it.", "He refused doing it.", "He promised doing it."], "e": "Отрицание → deny + герундий."}, {"s": "Report: «I'll help you,» she said.", "o": ["She denied helping.", "She refused to help.", "She offered to help.", "She admitted helping."], "e": "Предложение помощи → offer + to."}, {"s": "In reported speech «here» becomes:", "o": ["here", "where", "there", "near"], "e": "Наречие места меняется."}, {"s": "Report: «I'm sorry I broke it,» he said.", "o": ["He denied breaking it.", "He refused breaking it.", "He apologized for breaking it.", "He suggested breaking it."], "e": "Извинение → apologize for + герундий."}, {"s": "When is backshift NOT necessary?", "o": ["Never", "Always necessary", "When the statement is still true", "Only in questions"], "e": "В общеизвестных истинах время может не меняться."}]}, "Reported Speech — 2-ci toplu": "Косвенная речь — Сборник 2"}